---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: servicePages
  size: 1
  alias: service
title: "{{ service.title }}"
description: "{{ service.intro }}"
permalink: "/repair-services/{{ service.slug }}/"
---
<section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><div class="breadcrumb">Repair services / {{ service.title }}</div><h1>{{ service.title }}</h1><p>{{ service.intro }}</p></div></section>
{% if service.image %}<section class="section section--bright"><div class="shell service-media"><figure><img src="{{ service.image | url }}" alt="{{ service.imageAlt }}" width="1024" height="768" loading="eager"><figcaption>{{ service.imageNote }}</figcaption></figure><div class="prose"><div class="kicker">Project evidence</div><h2>Show the work as it develops.</h2><p>Where permission, safety, and the agreed project process allow, the project record can bring together photographs and short video from before work, during key stages, and after completion.</p><p>This gives the customer a clearer record of what was visible, what was opened or repaired, and what the finished work looks like. It must never expose private information or be published without the required consent.</p></div></div></section>{% endif %}
<section class="section"><div class="shell split"><div><div class="kicker">A practical starting point</div><h2>Bring the useful details.</h2></div><div class="prose"><ul>{% for point in service.points %}<li>{{ point }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><p class="policy-banner">{{ service.verify }}</p><p>Use the contact route to describe the problem and ask what information is needed next. No response time, guarantee, or scope is promised by this draft page.</p><a class="button" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Discuss this service</a></div></div></section>
{% set ctaTitle = "Need help choosing the right repair route?" %}{% include "components/cta.njk" %}
